==Battleground==
*Enemy base HP starts at 800,000 and increases by 40,000 with each stage.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30.67~34.67 seconds<sup>920f~1,040f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 14.67~20 seconds<sup>440f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 36~40 seconds<sup>1,080f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 37.33~40 seconds<sup>1,120f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 14.67~20 seconds<sup>440f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 14.67~20 seconds<sup>440f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Baron Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 57.33~60 seconds<sup>1,720f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 21.33~28 seconds<sup>640f~840f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns.
**6 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 48~50.67 seconds<sup>1,440f~1,520f</sup>.

