===Recommended Ubers===
*[[Shining Amaterasu (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Amaterasu]] - Deals massive damage to all enemies in the stage.
*[[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Chronos]] - Excellent unit, freezes all enemies, making the stage much more bearable.
*[[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Gao]] / Mighty Lord Gao - Spammable unit that can clear up weaker peons. In evolved form, Gao can deal great damage from the backline.
*[[Subaru Hoshi (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Subaru CC]] - Strong vs. Angel and Red, which counters the two main threats of this stage with long-distance.
*[[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]] - Helps to set up stacking Cyberpunk Cat. Can occasionally deal massive damage to a single target when deployed against waves of support. Works especially well with [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] in this gauntlet.
*[[Ice Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Ice Crystal Cat]] - Capable of freezing Baron Seal, nullifying the damage of the gauntlet's main pushing force.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]] / Jizo's Mega-Castle - Kasa Jizo's massive damage to Angel enemies is incredibly useful here. Their first form can clear out Gabriels and other peons, whereas Jizo's Mega-Castle can deal massive damage to Angelic Gory hordes, or even snipe Cala Maria.
*[[Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Mami Tomoe]] - Long-distance damage to Angel enemies.
*[[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Mitama The Oracle]] - Slows down all enemies. Replaces Cyberpunk Cat; although the two together can permaslow all enemies in the stage.
*[[Sharpshooter Saki (Uber Rare Cat)|Sharpshooter Saki]] - Long range, area attacks with piercing high damage to Red and Alien Enemies.
*[[Momotaro (Uber Rare Cat)|The Peach Devils]] - Decent attack power, and also can freeze Angel and Red enemies, making them useful against Baron Seal and Angelic Gory.
*[[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|Unit-02, Code 777]] - EVA Unit-02 can deal massive damage to Baron Seal from afar.

